Subject: [PATCH] feat: drag, menus and agent order in the multi-machine
 sidebar

Tree lines of the machine being shown drag and open their menu as on a single machine. Clicking any machine's line switches to it on release. next/previous/focus agent follow the tree across machines, most urgent group first, and focus_agent numbers show there too. Upstream's local_agent_click_can_cancel_a_pending_remote_switch and switching_machines_preserves_aggregate_agent_scroll_and_visible_rows expect the switch on mouse-down.

